  "body": "77A Reihana Street, located in the desirable suburb of Orakei, presents an excellent opportunity for developers or those looking to build a substantial new home in a premium location. Water meter installed and an approved vehicle crossing providing easy access to Reihana Street.\r\n\r\nThe property is positioned just moments from Tautari Reserve, offering a great lifestyle benefit with nearby green space. Zoned Mixed Housing Urban, the site provides increased flexibility and greater building coverage potential. A proposed new dwelling of approximately 291m² (more or less) makes this an ideal option for those seeking to develop a modern, spacious residence in a highly sought-after area.",
